- **Angles**: Use 30°, 45°, 60°, 90° angles only
- **Corners**: Sharp (no rounded corners except circles)
- **Rotation**: Elements can be rotated at standard angles
- **Overlap**: Encourage overlapping geometric forms
- **Symmetry**: Asymmetric compositions preferred (Futurist)

