## Design Consistency Rules

### **All Pages Must Include:**
1. Angular, geometric design elements
2. Sharp corners (no rounded except circles)
3. Asymmetric layouts where possible
4. Diagonal elements and speed lines
5. Gold, Deep Blue, Terracotta color palette
6. Space Grotesk headings, Crimson Pro body text
7. Angular animations (200-400ms)
8. High contrast for accessibility

### **All Pages Must NOT Include:**
1. Rounded corners (except circles)
2. Smooth, curved animations
3. Symmetric layouts (unless necessary)
4. Pastel colors
5. Organic shapes
6. Smooth gradients

